---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Spell Check is Global"
  description="About: Spell Check is Global. An economic opinion. People paid a premium for spell check. It is now free and bundled. Global access is for more than 7 billion people. Scarcity pricing is for fewer than 500 million people."
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Paper 5 · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Spell Check is Global
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This article is about what happens when technology is built for global access instead of priced by scarcity.
      The many are more than 7 billion people. The few are fewer than 500 million people.
      People used to pay a premium for spell check. It cannot be sold anymore. It is free, and it is bundled into the editor, the browser, and the phone.
      That is the finished case.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      It reached ordinary writing because it was cheap, local, and paired to hardware people already have: the editor, then the phone.
      The future of computer intelligence is that pattern.
      More than 7 billion people, and fewer than 500 million people. Global access against scarcity pricing.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm text-brand-gray leading-relaxed">
      An economic opinion. The companion page under /living/spellcheck/ is the teaching figure.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2" id="companion-laws">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Companion laws</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        The catalog triad stays intact:
        <a href="/papers/mol/" class="text-brand-cyan">Navigation</a> (Mixture of Limits) ·
        <a href="/papers/ni/" class="text-brand-cyan">Commit</a> (Notational Intelligence) ·
        <a href="/papers/satiation/" class="text-brand-cyan">Economic Reality of Satiation</a>.
        Fourth study: <a href="/papers/mei/" class="text-brand-cyan">Metabolic Intelligence</a> (energy budget; Klere is the product home, not a prison).
        This study is the automation path those laws are for.
        See <a href="/#spell-check" class="text-brand-cyan">the catalog strip</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/spellcheck/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read paper → /papers/spellcheck/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/spellcheck.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/living/spellcheck/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/30 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Companion page
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 glass-card p-6 space-y-3">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Paths</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/papers/spellcheck/</span> → study prose</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/pdfs/spellcheck.pdf</span> → downloadable study PDF (regenerate via scripts/generate-pdfs.sh)</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/living/spellcheck/</span> → companion page (not a meter, not the paper)</p>
      <p class="font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate"><span class="text-brand-cyan">/about/spellcheck/</span> → this page</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6 space-y-2">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray">Measurement bounds</p>
      <p class="font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        The prices are the prices the sources print. Hunspell's license price is zero.
        More than 7 billion people. Fewer than 500 million people.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
